@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Process - configure, select, review and execute
start
:Open paginated migration history;
:New migration: choose an enabled profile;
if (Profile has capture filters?) then (yes)
  :Set source and destination capture values;
else (no)
  :Use folder correspondences within matched courses;
endif
:Edit folder correspondence rows;
:Choose missing-target and overwrite behavior;
:Review section matching;
:Prepare all matching operations;
repeat
:Step 3: search bounded 10/25/50 file and issue pages;
:Include all or select courses / folders / files;
:Save automatically; update checks and approval digest;
if (Included blockers or unresolved placement issues?) then (yes)
  :Choose existing folder, proposed creation, overwrite or exclusion;
  :Retain old review and saved file exclusions;
endif
repeat while (Included blockers remain?) is (yes)
if (Included copy work remains?) then (yes)
  :Step 4: press Execute for the whole included set;
  :Require session key and execution permission;
  :Validate digest under the shared plan lock;
  :Queue every included operation;
  :Freeze selection and show progress / cancellation;
else (no)
  :Cancel empty plan automatically;
endif
stop
@enduml
